# ISECT of a horizontal line with lines at growing small angles. Observed:
# lines within about three degrees of parallel (19 |cross| <= |dot|) give the
# average of the four points, truncated.
heights 16384 1000
fpgm
  PUSH 0; FDEF; ENDF
end
glyph advance 600
  contour 500 700, 500 701, 500 702, 500 703, 500 704, 500 705, 500 706, 500 707, 500 708, 500 709, 500 710, 500 711, 500 712, 500 713, 500 714, 500 715, 500 716, 500 717, 500 718, 500 719, 500 720, 500 721, 500 722, 500 723, 500 724, 500 725, 500 726, 500 727, 500 728, 500 729, 0 0, 1000 0, 0 100, 1000 120, 1000 122, 1000 124, 1000 126, 1000 128, 1000 130, 1000 132, 1000 134, 1000 136, 1000 138, 1000 140, 1000 142, 1000 144, 1000 146, 1000 148, 1000 150, 1000 152, 1000 154, 1000 156, 1000 158, 1000 160, 1000 162, 1000 164, 1000 166, 1000 168, 1000 170, 1000 172, 1000 174, 1000 176, 1000 178
  program
    PUSH 0 30 31 32 33; ISECT; PUSH 1 30 31 32 34; ISECT; PUSH 2 30 31 32 35; ISECT; PUSH 3 30 31 32 36; ISECT; PUSH 4 30 31 32 37; ISECT; PUSH 5 30 31 32 38; ISECT; PUSH 6 30 31 32 39; ISECT; PUSH 7 30 31 32 40; ISECT; PUSH 8 30 31 32 41; ISECT; PUSH 9 30 31 32 42; ISECT; PUSH 10 30 31 32 43; ISECT; PUSH 11 30 31 32 44; ISECT; PUSH 12 30 31 32 45; ISECT; PUSH 13 30 31 32 46; ISECT; PUSH 14 30 31 32 47; ISECT; PUSH 15 30 31 32 48; ISECT; PUSH 16 30 31 32 49; ISECT; PUSH 17 30 31 32 50; ISECT; PUSH 18 30 31 32 51; ISECT; PUSH 19 30 31 32 52; ISECT; PUSH 20 30 31 32 53; ISECT; PUSH 21 30 31 32 54; ISECT; PUSH 22 30 31 32 55; ISECT; PUSH 23 30 31 32 56; ISECT; PUSH 24 30 31 32 57; ISECT; PUSH 25 30 31 32 58; ISECT; PUSH 26 30 31 32 59; ISECT; PUSH 27 30 31 32 60; ISECT; PUSH 28 30 31 32 61; ISECT; PUSH 29 30 31 32 62; ISECT
  end
end
